# A larger distillation cut collects more
register lv2
add v1 water 3.55mol
add v1 ethanol 0.2mol
add v1 methanol 0.05mol
new
distil v1 v2 0.08
new
add v3 water 3.55mol
add v3 ethanol 0.2mol
add v3 methanol 0.05mol
new
distil v3 v4 0.16
inspect v2
inspect v4
# The equilibrium cut is not a prediction of real column performance or purity.
